# Written by `next dev` (node_modules/next/dist/server/lib/generate-agent-files.js),
# not authored project configuration. The repository's own agent instructions
# live in the root AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash so these only ever match the two generated files
# in this directory. Unanchored, they match at any depth, and on a
# case-insensitive filesystem `CLAUDE.md` also swallows
# `content/docs/harnesses/claude.md` - which stays on disk, silently never gets
# committed, and breaks the build everywhere but the machine that wrote it.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
